    636.5416698455812,
    521.8021011352539,
    646.541669845581
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999886
  },
  {
   "text": "Research on the benefits of PCCT for imaging of vascular",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    624.2500000000001,
    545.8958435058595,
    634.25
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999886
  },
  {
   "text": "calcifications has shown that, compared with EID CT, the",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    612.2812538146973,
    545.9166717529297,
    622.2812538146973
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "estimated volume of calcifications at PCCT is closer to the",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    600.2291564941406,
    545.9270858764648,
    610.2291564941406
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "physical volume of the anthropomorphic phantom (19,20)",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    588.2604293823243,
    545.8958435058595,
    598.2604293823242
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999886
  },
  {
   "text": "and to that estimated with micro-CT in cadaveric speci-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    576.28125,
    545.9166717529297,
    586.28125
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "mens (21). This improvement is thought to mainly be due",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    564.3125038146973,
    545.8958435058595,
    574.3125038146973
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "to improved spatial resolution and the reduction of bloom-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    552.2604064941406,
    545.8646011352539,
    562.2604064941407
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000114
  },
  {
   "text": "ing artifacts (1921). With PCCT, blooming artifacts can",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    540.2916793823242,
    545.8750152587891,
    550.2916793823242
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "be further reduced on VMIs at high energies (22), as has",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    528.3125,
    545.9270858764648,
    538.3125
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "already been demonstrated with DECT (23). In addition,",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    516.3437538146973,
    545.8958435058595,
    526.3437538146973
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "PCCT is capable of detecting smaller (as small as 0.5-mm)",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    504.2916564941406,
    545.8750152587891,
    514.2916564941406
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "and less-dense calcifications, shows an increased contrast-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    492.3229293823243,
    545.8958435058595,
    502.3229293823243
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "to-noise ratio (CNR) (eg, from 4.5 to 5.0 for inserts of",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    480.35416412353516,
    545.8854293823242,
    490.3541641235352
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "200 HU), and allows visibility of dense calcifications at a",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    468.37500381469727,
    545.8646011352539,
    478.37500381469727
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "lower radiation dose compared with EID CT (19,24,25).",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    456.3229064941406,
    545.9270858764648,
    466.3229064941407
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "Although coronary artery calcium assessment with the tra-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    444.3541793823242,
    545.8958435058595,
    454.35417938232416
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "ditional Agatston score is comparable between PCCT and",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    432.3854141235352,
    545.9062576293945,
    442.38541412353516
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "EID CT (20), broader use of PCCT might result in the",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    420.4062347412109,
    545.8750152587891,
    430.40623474121094
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "definition of new scores that, for example, include the newly",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    408.3645706176757,
    545.8958435058595,
    418.3645706176758
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "detectable and less-dense calcifications. Furthermore, in-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    396.3854293823242,
    545.8854293823242,
    406.3854293823243
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "creased use of PCCT could lead to changes in acquisition",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    384.41666412353516,
    545.9062576293945,
    394.41666412353516
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "protocols, such as lowering the radiation dose needed for",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    372.4479370117188,
    545.8750152587891,
    382.44793701171875
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "accurate imaging. However, at present, coronary artery cal-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    360.3958206176758,
    545.8750152587891,
    370.3958206176758
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "cium score studies with PCCT in humans remain limited,",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    348.4166793823242,
    545.9270858764648,
    358.4166793823242
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "and those that have been performed did not use electrocar-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    336.4479141235351,
    545.8750152587891,
    346.44791412353516
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "diographic gating (22,25).",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    324.4791870117188,
    412.27084159851074,
    334.47918701171875
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "Coronary Stents",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    300.77084350585943,
    368.6145973205567,
    310.7708435058594
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "Coronary stents have been imaged with PCCT in vitro in differ-",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    288.47916412353516,
    545.9270858764648,
    298.4791641235352
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "ent experimental settings. All these studies reported similar main",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    276.4270858764648,
    545.8750152587891,
    286.42708587646484
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "findings: Compared with EID CT, PCCT depicted the structure",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    264.4583206176758,
    545.9062576293945,
    274.4583206176757
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "of the stent better, estimated strut dimensions closer to the true",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    252.48959350585935,
    545.9270858764648,
    262.48959350585943
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000085
  },
  {
   "text": "dimensions, enabled easier detection of calcifications adjacent to",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    240.51041412353516,
    545.9270858764648,
    250.5104141235351
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "the stent, and reduced the artifacts inside the stent, allowing for",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    228.45833587646482,
    545.8854293823242,
    238.45833587646487
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "improved assessment of intrastent stenosis (2630). Boccalini",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    216.48957061767578,
    545.9062576293945,
    226.48957061767575
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999972
  },
  {
   "text": "and Si-Mohamed et al (9) conducted an objective analysis that",
   "rect": [
    305.89584350585943,
    204.52084350585935,
    545.8958435058595,
    214.5208435058594
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "binding energy of the K shell. Availability of K-edge imag-",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    398.4270935058594,
    288.0104064941406,
    408.4270935058594
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "ing could prompt the development of new contrast materials,",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    386.3750152587891,
    287.99999237060547,
    396.37501525878906
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "possibly allowing for an earlier and more specific detection of",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    374.3958358764649,
    287.93750762939453,
    384.39583587646484
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "pathologic abnormalities as well as for the broadening of the",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    362.4270706176758,
    287.9895782470703,
    372.42707061767584
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "spectrum of diseases detectable with CT.",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    350.4583435058594,
    208.03125381469727,
    360.4583435058594
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "While all major manufacturers are currently developing PCCT",
   "rect": [
    59.96874809265137,
    338.4062652587891,
    287.9479122161865,
    348.40626525878906
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "systems, to our knowledge, only the Siemens and Philips systems",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    326.4375,
    287.99999237060547,
    336.43750000000006
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "have been clinically investigated in the literature. This review ar-",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    314.4583206176758,
    287.9895782470703,
    324.4583206176757
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "ticle reports the clinical benefits of this technology in cardiovascu-",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    302.4895935058594,
    287.93750762939453,
    312.48959350585943
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "lar, lung, musculoskeletal, and temporal bone applications. It also",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    290.437515258789,
    287.9479217529297,
    300.43751525878906
   ],
   "fontSize": 10.000000000000057
  },
  {
   "text": "discusses the possible benefits of using this imaging modality for",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    278.46875,
    287.95833587646484,
    288.46874999999994
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
   "text": "other applications as well as future directions related to the use of",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    266.4895706176758,
    287.95833587646484,
    276.4895706176758
   ],
   "fontSize": 10
  },
  {
   "text": "new K-edgebased contrast materials with PCCT.",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    254.52084350585938,
    231.18749618530273,
    264.5208435058593
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999943
  },
  {
