    287.95833587646484,
    226.48957061767575
   ],
   "fontSize": 9.999999999999972
  },
  {
   "text": "Table 1. In Table 2, a list of terms referring to different types of",
   "rect": [
    47.96875,
    204.52084350585935,
    287.9895782470703,
    214.5208435058594
