    59.104166030883796,
    600.2916793823242
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.500003814697266
  },
  {
   "text": "CT systems equipped with photon-counting detectors, referred to",
   "rect": [
    62.989587783813484,
    591.791675567627,
    278.3437442779541,
    600.2916793823242
   ],
   "fontSize": 8.500003814697266
  },
  {
   "text": "as photon-counting CT (PCCT), provide advantages in clinical",
